      "text": "3. 核心训练创新：Masked Trajectory + 2D Attention Mask",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. 核心训练创新：Masked Trajectory + 2D Attention Mask",
      "lineHeight": 1.28,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt_0032",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2384,
      "y": 1085.1,
      "width": 2361.0,
      "height": 138.6,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#212529",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 486546387,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1625677747,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795360018465,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• 难点：动态剪枝破坏了标准 PPO / Reinforce++ 依赖的连续线性轨迹假设；\n• 解法：将多轮剪枝状态拼接为逻辑完整轨迹，用 2D Attention Mask 精确限制每个 token 仅关注生成时刻实际留存的上下文，并叠加 1D Info Mask 屏蔽外部观察 token 不参与梯度\n  更新。",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• 难点：动态剪枝破坏了标准 PPO / Reinforce++ 依赖的连续线性轨迹假设；\n• 解法：将多轮剪枝状态拼接为逻辑完整轨迹，用 2D Attention Mask 精确限制每个 token 仅关注生成时刻实际留存的上下文，并叠加 1D Info Mask 屏蔽外部观察 token 不参与梯度\n  更新。",
      "lineHeight": 1.65,
      "autoResize": true
    },
