      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795360018465,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "原论文核心实证结论（三领域 + 16 目标长程外推）",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "原论文核心实证结论（三领域 + 16 目标长程外推）",
      "lineHeight": 1.28,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt_0084",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 92,
      "y": 2412.1,
      "width": 2269.8,
      "height": 138.6,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#212529",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 891723481,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 318838948,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795360018465,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• 效率与精度双突破：在 16-objective 多跳 QA 任务上，MEM1-7B 相比参数量翻倍的 Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct 性能提升 3.5 倍，同时内存占用降低 3.7 倍；\n• 跨领域与超长程外推：在内部检索 QA、开放域网页 QA 与多轮网购（Web Shopping）三个领域均显著领先全上下文与摘要基线，且在测试时能够稳定泛化到超出训练轮数上限\n  的长程任务（开源代码：MIT-MI/MEM1）。",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• 效率与精度双突破：在 16-objective 多跳 QA 任务上，MEM1-7B 相比参数量翻倍的 Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct 性能提升 3.5 倍，同时内存占用降低 3.7 倍；\n• 跨领域与超长程外推：在内部检索 QA、开放域网页 QA 与多轮网购（Web Shopping）三个领域均显著领先全上下文与摘要基线，且在测试时能够稳定泛化到超出训练轮数上限\n  的长程任务（开源代码：MIT-MI/MEM1）。",
      "lineHeight": 1.65,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
